{
  "title": "Supplications at Sunrise & Sunset",
  "data": "The following supplication is reported to be said at sunrise and sunset:\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِيْ يَفْعَلُ مَا يَشَآءُ وَ لَا يَفْعَلُ مَا يَشَآءُ غَيْرُهٗ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHIL LAZEE YAF'ALU MAA YASHAAA'U WA LAA YAF'ALU MAA YASHAAA'U GHAYRUH\nAll praise is due to Allah Who does whatever He wills, and none besides Him can do whatever he wills.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ كَمَا يُحِبُّ اللّٰهُ اَنْ يُّحْمَدَ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHI KAMAA YUHIBBULLAAHU AY YUHMAD\nAll praise is due to Allah as Allah loves to be praised.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ كَمَا هُوَ اَهْلُهٗ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHI KAMAA HUWA AHLUH\nAll praise is due to Allah as He deserves.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَدْخِلْنِيْ فِيْ كُلِّ خَيْرٍ اَدْخَلْتَ فِيْهِ مُحَمَّدًا وَّ اٰلَ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA ADKHILNEE FEE KULLI KHAYRIN ADKHALTA FEEHI MUHAMMADAN WA AALA MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, include me in every good in which You have included Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَ اَخْرِجْنِيْ مِنْ كُلِّ سُوْٓءٍ اَخْرَجْتَ مِنْهُ مُحَمَّدًا وَّ اٰلَ مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA AKHRIJNEE MIN KULLI SOOO'IN AKHRAJTA MINHU MUHAMMADAN WA AALA MUHAMMAD, SALLALLAAHU A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nand take me out of every evil from which You have taken out Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad — blessings of Allah be upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad.",
  "merits": "Many supplications have been reported from the Holy Prophet and the Holy Imams (a.s.) to be said at sunrise and sunset."
}
